
NTeX Release 1.2 --- ntb-djc 0.1 --- status: optional

This are the binaries for the dvi driver for the HP Deskjet 500, 500c 
and 550c. They do not use that kpathsea library and expect the pk files
for the Deskjet in the directory /usr/lib/texmf/pk and the tfm files
in /usr/lib/texmf/tfm. So if you want to use this drivers you have to
copy the pk and tfm files in these directories or make a symbolic link
from these directories to the pk and tfm files. I could not test these
drivers, but they seem to work if the font-files are in the appropriate 
directories. If someone knows more about these drivers or has a 
kpathsea library version of them please let me know. The sources of the
drivers could be found in the package nts-djc

